# Phase 3 Implementation Plan: TypeScript & Backend Code Quality

This plan details the step-by-step migration of the "FairShare" frontend to TypeScript and the introduction of enterprise-grade input validation and global error handling on the Express backend.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Build Validation:**
> During migration, the frontend code might throw compilation errors until all main components are updated to TypeScript. We will migrate key configurations, utility files, and contexts first, and then migrate page components one by one.
>
> **No Functional Changes:**
> We will preserve all existing functionality, styles, and logic exactly as they are. The goal is purely architectural enhancement.

